    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.indentscope\n\n### Description\n\nAs in title. Lagging is due to recomputation of scope on every cursor move. Setting big `config.draw.delay` doesn't help as it affects only when drawing is started.\r\n\r\nExample file with reproduced lagging had 300K scope:\r\n```\r\n0\r\n                    1\r\n                    2\r\n                    3\r\n...\r\n                    300000\r\n```",
    "closed_at": "2025-01-16T13:48:20Z",
